  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A particle is executing simple harmonic oscillations with total energy <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E\"></span> and amplitude <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x_{0}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the kinetic energy of the particle when the displacement from the equilibrium position is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{x_{0}}{2}\"></span>?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{E}{4}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{E}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3E}{4}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{E\\sqrt{3}}{2}\"></span></li></ol>"
